direction: down

source: Current Unfolded tab
choice: Choose how to invite another screen {
  shape: diamond
}
handoff-link: QR or live handoff link
code: 6-character pairing code
browser: Any modern browser
valid: Is the link token valid and unused? {
  shape: diamond
}
claim-link: Join once, then remove the token from the URL
copy: Open the design as an independent copy
minted: Where was the code created? {
  shape: diamond
}
agent: ChatGPT calls join_session
enter: Person enters the agent's code, or taps the link minted with it
clipboard: Either one, copied: Unfolded offers a one-tap join
session: Durable Object keeps the canonical design state
result: Edits flow both ways in about a second

source -> choice
choice -> handoff-link: Tap or scan
choice -> code: Speak or paste
handoff-link -> browser
handoff-link -> clipboard: Copied, not tapped
code -> clipboard: Copied, not typed
clipboard -> session
browser -> valid
valid -> claim-link: Yes
valid -> copy: No
code -> minted
minted -> agent: Unfolded tab
minted -> enter: ChatGPT tab
claim-link -> session
agent -> session
enter -> session
session -> result

*.style.border-radius: 12
source.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
source.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
choice.style.fill: "#fef3c7"
choice.style.stroke: "#d97706"
handoff-link.style.fill: "#ffedd5"
handoff-link.style.stroke: "#ea580c"
code.style.fill: "#ffedd5"
code.style.stroke: "#ea580c"
browser.style.fill: "#f5f5f4"
browser.style.stroke: "#78716c"
valid.style.fill: "#fef3c7"
valid.style.stroke: "#d97706"
agent.style.fill: "#ede9fe"
agent.style.stroke: "#7c3aed"
claim-link.style.fill: "#ffedd5"
claim-link.style.stroke: "#ea580c"
copy.style.fill: "#f5f5f4"
copy.style.stroke: "#78716c"
minted.style.fill: "#fef3c7"
minted.style.stroke: "#d97706"
enter.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
enter.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
clipboard.style.fill: "#dbeafe"
clipboard.style.stroke: "#2563eb"
session.style.fill: "#e0f2fe"
